3. No resale

You may not sell, rent, or charge for access to the Package, its templates, or
modified versions of them. This includes placing them behind a paywall or
subscription, or bundling them with a paid product or service that supplies the
Package or templates to customers. Renaming or modifying them does not remove
this restriction.

You may charge for creating or tailoring a personalized CV, provided the customer
receives the personalized CV rather than the Package or a reusable template.
Using the Package internally in a business is permitted.

